OL,3,AThe tech helping crack decades-old cold
OL,4,Acases
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor three decades, investigators from
OL,7,Fthe Madison County Sheriff's Office
OL,8,Fchased leads and interviewed hundreds
OL,9,Fof people as they attempted to identify
OL,10,Fthe perpetrator.
